{"task_id": "HumanEval/57", "solution": "```python\ndef monotonic(l: list):\n    \"\"\"Return True is list elements are monotonically increasing or decreasing.\"\"\"\n    if len(l) <= 1:\n        return True\n\n    def _is_increasing(arr: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a list is monotonically increasing.\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] > arr[i+1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    def _is_decreasing(arr: list) -> bool:\n        \"\"\"Checks if a list is monotonically decreasing.\"\"\"\n        for i in range(len(arr) - 1):\n            if arr[i] < arr[i+1]:\n                return False\n        return True\n\n    return _is_increasing(l) or _is_decreasing(l)\n```"}
